>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/rp6-1890x1418.webp\" alt=\"Contemporary luxury bungalow with brick detailing, wood-textured finishes, and a covered car porch in Kandar, Solapur, designed by Mahaconstro Architects.\" title data-slide-to=\"14\" data-bs-slide-to=\"14\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Card Title</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <h1 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                            <b style>Kandar residence</b><i>&nbsp;</i></h1>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Card Text. You don't have to code to create\n                            a site. Select one of available themes in the Mobirise Site Builder.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"page13.html\" class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">View Project</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/kp-render3-1890x1417.webp\" alt=\"Contemporary Anandvan Residency apartment building with modern facade and spacious balconies in Tembhurni, Solapur, designed by Mahaconstro Architects.\" title data-slide-to=\"15\" data-bs-slide-to=\"15\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Card Title</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <h1 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                            <b style>Anandvan residency</b></h1>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Card Text. You don't have to code to create\n                            a site. Select one of available themes in the Mobirise Site Builder.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"page12.html\" class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">View Project</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/sstf12-1890x1417.webp\" alt=\"Landscape garden at Shree Sai Realty in Tembhurni, Solapur, featuring curved walkways, tropical planting, open lawns, and recreational spaces designed by Mahaconstro Architects.\" title data-slide-to=\"16\" data-bs-slide-to=\"16\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Card Title</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <h1 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                            <b style>A landscape of lesure</b></h1>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Card Text. You don't have to code to create\n                            a site. Select one of available themes in the Mobirise Site Builder.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"page15.html\" class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">View Project</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/sstf28-1890x1417.webp\" alt=\"Modern luxury plotting entrance gateway at Sai Sparsh in Tembhurni, Solapur, featuring a contemporary canopy and stone-clad entrance structure designed by Mahaconstro Architects.\" title data-slide-to=\"17\" data-bs-slide-to=\"17\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Card Title</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <h1 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                            <b style>Sai sparsh</b></h1>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Card Text. You don't have to code to create\n                            a site. Select one of available themes in the Mobirise Site Builder.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"page14.html\" class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">View Project</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/stk6-3840x2880.webp\" alt=\"Contemporary luxury lodge architecture at Satkar Lodge in Tembhurni, Solapur, designed by Mahaconstro Architects.\" title data-slide-to=\"18\" data-bs-slide-to=\"18\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Card Title</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <h1 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                            <b style>Satkar lodge&nbsp;</b></h1>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Card Text. You don't have to code to create\n                            a site. Select one of available themes in the Mobirise Site Builder.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"page18.html\" class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">View Project</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vyzAnih3RH",
          "_anchor": "gallery1-1n",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".card-box": {
                "padding": "1rem"
              }
            },
            "@media (min-width: 768px)": {
              ".card-box": {
                "padding-right": "2rem"
              }
            },
            "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
              ".card-box": {
                "padding-left": "2rem",
                "padding-right": "4rem"
              }
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "border-radius": "4px",
              "background-color": "@cardsBg",
              "& when (@transparentCard)": {
                "background-color": "transparent"
              }
            },
            ".image-wrapper img": {
              "width": "100%",
              "object-fit": "cover"
            },
            ".item:not(:nth-last-child(1))": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem"
            }
          },
          "_name": "features9",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features9\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/html\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"3\" max=\"7\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Price\" name=\"showPrice\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparentCard\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"cardsBg\" value=\"#fafafa\" condition=\"!transparentCard\">\n        <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n            <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"12\" selected>1</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#fafafa\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#bed3f9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid' : fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"item features-image\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/professional20desk20setup20cutout-596x707.webp\" alt=\"mahaconstro founder\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <div class=\"row\">\n                                <div class=\"col-md\">\n                                    <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                                        <b>Camera</b>\n                                    </h6>\n                                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\"><b>Abhijit Mane\n</b><br>Founder &amp; Principal Designer\n<br>\n<br>Mahaconstro Architects, led by Abhijit Mane &amp; Associates, is driven by a vision to create distinctive spaces through innovative architecture, refined interiors, and thoughtful landscape design. Every project reflects a balance of creativity, functionality, and contemporary aesthetics, transforming ideas into inspiring spaces.<br><br><b>Design Philosophy</b><br>We believe exceptional design extends beyond visual appeal. It is about creating spaces that feel intuitive, function effortlessly, and inspire meaningful experiences. Every design begins with a clear purpose and evolves through creativity, thoughtful planning, and attention to detail.<br><br><b>Our approach</b><br> we believe every space should serve a purpose while expressing a distinct identity. Our approach integrates architectural clarity, refined interiors, and a thoughtful understanding of materials, proportions, natural light, and spatial relationships. <br><br><b>Our vision</b><br> Our vision is to create architecture and interiors that transcend conventional expectations by bringing together innovation, functionality, and timeless aesthetics. We aspire to design environments that enrich everyday living, reflect individual identities, and remain relevant beyond changing trends.<br></p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"col-md-auto\" mbr-if=\"showPrice || showButtons\">\n                                    <p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\" data-app-selector=\".price\">$29</p>\n                                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                            Buy Now\n                                        </a></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-2 d-none d-lg-block' : fullWidth}\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        \n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "features9-t",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vyvearSNAV",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "testimonials3",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".carousel-item": {
              "justify-content": "center"
            },
            ".carousel-item.active, .carousel-item-next, .carousel-item-prev": {
              "display": "flex"
            },
            ".carousel-controls": {
              "a": {
                "transition": "opacity .5s",
                "font-size": "30px",
                "position": "absolute",
                "top": "180px",
                "bottom": "auto",
                "height": "60px",
                "width": "60px",
                "padding": "10px",
                "color": "#e85a4f",
                ".mbr-iconfont": {
                  "font-weight": "800"
                }
              }
            },
            ".carousel-control-next": {
              "span": {
                "padding-left": "5px"
              }
            },
            ".carousel-control-prev": {
              "span": {
                "padding-right": "5px"
              }
            },
            ".user_image": {
              "width": "200px",
              "height": "200px",
              "margin-bottom": "1.6rem",
              "overflow": "hidden",
              "border-radius": "50%",
              "margin": "0 auto 2rem auto",
              "img": {
                "width": "100%",
                "min-width": "100%",
                "min-height": "100%"
              },
              "display": "none !important"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 230px)": {
              ".user_image": {
                "width": "100%",
                "height": "auto"
              }
            },
            "H3": {
              "color": "#e85a4f"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"testimonails3 carousel slide testimonials-slider\" group=\"Testimonials\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"BootstrapCarouselSwipe,mbr-testimonials-slider\" data-interval=\"false\" data-bs-interval=\"false\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\">\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Padding Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" inline>\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Padding Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" inline>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Author Name\" name=\"showName\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Author Title\" name=\"showDesk\" checked>\n        <header>Slides</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Items\" name=\"testimonialsSlides\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Autoplay\" name=\"showAutoplay\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Interval\" name=\"interval\" min=\"1\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"showAutoplay\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#eae7dc\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"text-center\" mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n            <b>Testimonials</b>\n        </h3>\n\n        <div class=\"carousel slide\" role=\"listbox\" data-pause=\"true\" data-keyboard=\"false\" data-ride=\"{{showAutoplay ? 'carousel' : 'false'}}\" data-bs-ride=\"{{showAutoplay ? 'carousel' : 'false'}}\" data-interval=\"{{showAutoplay ? interval*1000 : 'false'}}\" data-bs-interval=\"{{showAutoplay ? interval*1000 : 'false'}}\">\n            <div mbr-list mbr-list-grow=\"testimonialsSlides\" class=\"carousel-inner\">\n                <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n                    <div class=\"user col-md-8\">\n                        <div class=\"user_image\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/team3-1.webp\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"user_text mb-4\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">\n                                “Their approach to planning and presentation gave us a clear understanding of the design before moving forward. The team was receptive to our requirements and preferences.”\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\"><b>Nikhil Shah</b></div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">\n                            Client\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n                    <div class=\"user col-md-8\">\n                        <div class=\"user_image\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/team2-1.webp\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"user_text mb-4\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">\n                                “A refreshing design experience with a strong focus on our needs. Their contemporary vision and personalized approach helped us shape a space that feels both distinctive and welcoming.”\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\"><b>Sanket More</b></div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">\n                            Client\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n                    <div class=\"user col-md-8\">\n                        <div class=\"user_image\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/team4-1.webp\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"user_text mb-4\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">\n                                “We appreciated the thoughtful material selection, elegant detailing, and practical design solutions. Every element felt carefully considered and aligned with our expectations.”\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\"><b>Pravin Jadhav</b></div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">\n                            Client</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item\">\n                    <div class=\"user col-md-8\">\n                        <div class=\"user_image\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/team4-1.webp\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"user_text mb-4\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">\n                                “From the initial concept to the final design, the process was smooth and professional. Their creative ideas helped us make the most of our space.”\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\"><b>Sneha Kulkarni</b></div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">\n                            Client</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item\">\n                    <div class=\"user col-md-8\">\n                        <div class=\"user_image\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/team4-1.webp\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"user_text mb-4\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">\n                                “We wanted a distinctive home that reflected our lifestyle, and the design exceeded our expectations. The balance of elegance, comfort, and functionality was impressive.”\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\"><b>Amit &amp; Pooja Patil</b></div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">\n                            Client</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item\">\n                    <div class=\"user col-md-8\">\n                        <div class=\"user_image\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/team4-1.webp\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"user_text mb-4\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">\n                                “The team understood our vision perfectly and transformed it into a beautiful, functional design. The attention to detail and modern approach made the entire experience worthwhile.”\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\"><b>Rahul Deshmukh</b></div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">\n                            Client</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div></div>\n\n            <div class=\"carousel-controls\">\n                <a class=\"carousel-control-prev\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"prev\" data-bs-slide=\"prev\">\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-prev mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden\">Previous</span>\n                </a>\n\n                <a class=\"carousel-control-next\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"next\" data-bs-slide=\"next\">\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden\">Next</span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_anchor": "testimonials3-10",
