xt\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Card Text. You don't have to code to create\n                            a site. Select one of available themes in the Mobirise Site Builder.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons=\"\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"\" class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn\n                            more</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} active\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/abt19-1440x1080.webp\" alt=\"Contemporary ultra-luxury bungalow architecture at Shantiniketan in Tembhurni, Solapur, designed by Mahaconstro Architects.\" title=\"\" data-slide-to=\"18\" data-bs-slide-to=\"18\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Card Title</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                            <i>Card Subtitle</i>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Card Text. You don't have to code to create\n                            a site. Select one of available themes in the Mobirise Site Builder.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons=\"\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"\" class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn\n                            more</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} active\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/abt20-1440x1080.webp\" alt=\"Contemporary ultra-luxury bungalow architecture at Shantiniketan in Tembhurni, Solapur, designed by Mahaconstro Architects.\" title=\"\" data-slide-to=\"19\" data-bs-slide-to=\"19\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Card Title</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                            <i>Card Subtitle</i>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Card Text. You don't have to code to create\n                            a site. Select one of available themes in the Mobirise Site Builder.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons=\"\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"\" class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn\n                            more</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} active\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/abt21-1440x1080.webp\" alt=\"Contemporary ultra-luxury bungalow architecture at Shantiniketan in Tembhurni, Solapur, designed by Mahaconstro Architects.\" title=\"\" data-slide-to=\"20\" data-bs-slide-to=\"20\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Card Title</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                            <i>Card Subtitle</i>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Card Text. You don't have to code to create\n                            a site. Select one of available themes in the Mobirise Site Builder.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons=\"\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"\" class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn\n                            more</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} active\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/abt22-1440x1080.webp\" alt=\"Contemporary ultra-luxury bungalow architecture at Shantiniketan in Tembhurni, Solapur, designed by Mahaconstro Architects.\" title=\"\" data-slide-to=\"21\" data-bs-slide-to=\"21\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Card Title</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                            <i>Card Subtitle</i>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Card Text. You don't have to code to create\n                            a site. Select one of available themes in the Mobirise Site Builder.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons=\"\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"\" class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn\n                            more</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vyAgl8fktW",
